    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_title">About DiskQuilt</string>
    <string name="about_body">DiskQuilt reads your storage on this device only. There is no account, no upload and no analytics.\n\nIt needs “all files access” to enumerate every readable file. Android still hides Android/data, Android/obb and other apps\u2019 private data unless the phone is rooted; the result screen says how much was out of reach.\n\nDeletes are permanent: no trash, no undo.</string>
